#. ~ Description of "Out-of-place manuscript"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/books_deduction.json
msgid ""
"This book always feels like it shouldn't be where it is.  Its texts are "
"incoherent and illogical, but they promise to help you understand something."
"  Reading a few words from its pages is enough to give you a headache."
msgstr ""

