#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/books_deduction.json
msgid "Lies"
msgid_plural "copies of Lies"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#. ~ Description of "Lies"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/books_deduction.json
msgid ""
"A haphazardly-written book filled with ramblings about something it calls \"the Lies\".  You feel threatened by this book, uneasy at the thought of having it on your person, but parsing its texts could give you insight on how things truly are.\n"
"Only the first third of the pages are filled with text, and the last written page is splattered in red."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_READ_BOOK_LIES"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/books_deduction.json
msgid "Fortunately, you lack the deductive abilities to understand this book."
msgstr ""

